OL,3,GNEWSAWhat big issues are on the agenda
OL,4,Aas Stormont returns after summer?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's not even the start of a new
OL,7,FStormont term and already there have
OL,8,Fbeen leaks.
OL,10,FAlbeit in this case it wasn't some big
OL,11,Fscoop but a rather damp surprise for
OL,12,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,13,F(SDLP)'s Colin McGrath, who took to
OL,14,Fsocial media saying a water leak over
OL,15,Fsummer had left his assembly office
OL,16,Flooking worse for wear.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
